{"seq":3,"slug":"webhooks-validation","title":"Webhook 准入控制开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/development/webhooks-validation","wordCount":1177,"readingTime":5,"html":"<h1 id=\"webhook-准入控制开发\">Webhook 准入控制开发</h1><p>Kubernetes Admission Webhook 在 API 请求到达 etcd 持久化之前提供拦截点——Mutating Webhook 修改请求对象，Validating Webhook 批准或拒绝请求。对于 Operator 开发者，Webhook 是实现 CRD 无法通过 OpenAPI Schema 或 CEL 表达的复杂校验和环境感知默认值的标准手段。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Mutating Webhook</strong>：在准入阶段修改请求对象（注入默认值、添加 sidecar），先于 Validating 执行</li>\n<li><strong>Validating Webhook</strong>：在准入阶段批准或拒绝请求，适用于需要外部查找的校验逻辑</li>\n<li><strong>failurePolicy</strong>：Fail（不可达则拒绝）vs Ignore（不可达则放行），决定 Webhook 的可用性影响</li>\n<li><strong>CEL 优先原则</strong>：能用声明式（Schema/CEL）解决的校验不引入 Webhook，减少可用性依赖</li>\n<li><strong>Conversion Webhook</strong>：CRD 多版本并存时的版本转换机制，基于 Hub-Spoke 模型</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"准入链与-webhook-位置\">准入链与 Webhook 位置</h2><p>Kubernetes API Server 对每个写请求执行一条固定的准入链。理解 Webhook 在链中的位置是正确使用它的前提：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    A[客户端请求: kubectl apply] --&gt; B[认证 Authentication]&#10;    B --&gt; C[授权 Authorization]&#10;    C --&gt; D[Mutating Admission Webhooks]&#10;    D --&gt; E[Object Schema Validation]&#10;    E --&gt; F[CEL Validation Rules]&#10;    F --&gt; G[Validating Admission Webhooks]&#10;    G --&gt; H{全部通过?}&#10;    H --&gt;|是| I[写入 etcd]&#10;    H --&gt;|否| J[返回 403/422 拒绝]\">flowchart TD\n    A[客户端请求: kubectl apply] --&gt; B[认证 Authentication]\n    B --&gt; C[授权 Authorization]\n    C --&gt; D[Mutating Admission Webhooks]\n    D --&gt; E[Object Schema Validation]\n    E --&gt; F[CEL Validation Rules]\n    F --&gt; G[Validating Admission Webhooks]\n    G --&gt; H{全部通过?}\n    H --&gt;|是| I[写入 etcd]\n    H --&gt;|否| J[返回 403/422 拒绝]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>阶段</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>能力</th>\n<th>限制</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Mutating Webhook</td>\n<td>修改型</td>\n<td>修改请求对象的任意字段</td>\n<td>不能拒绝请求（只能修改）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OpenAPI Schema Validation</td>\n<td>声明式</td>\n<td>类型、格式、范围、必填</td>\n<td>不支持跨字段逻辑</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CEL Validation Rules</td>\n<td>声明式</td>\n<td>跨字段表达式校验</td>\n<td>不支持外部查找</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Validating Webhook</td>\n<td>校验型</td>\n<td>任意逻辑（含外部调用）</td>\n<td>不能修改对象</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>执行顺序的意义</strong>：Mutating Webhook 先于 Validating Webhook 执行。这意味着 Validating Webhook 看到的是<strong>已被修改后</strong>的对象。如果 Mutating Webhook 注入了默认值，Validating Webhook 的规则可以假设这些字段已存在。</p>\n<h2 id=\"何时使用-webhook-vs-cel-vs-controller\">何时使用 Webhook vs CEL vs Controller</h2><p>选择正确的校验/默认值层级是 Operator 设计的关键决策：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>需求</th>\n<th>推荐方案</th>\n<th>理由</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字段值范围（min/max/enum）</td>\n<td>OpenAPI Schema</td>\n<td>零延迟，无外部依赖</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>跨字段逻辑（if A then B）</td>\n<td>CEL Rules</td>\n<td>声明式，无需运行服务</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>字段不可变性</td>\n<td>CEL + <code>oldSelf</code></td>\n<td>内置支持，1.28+ GA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认值只依赖当前对象</td>\n<td>OpenAPI <code>default</code></td>\n<td>最简单，无运行时组件</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>默认值依赖环境/namespace/外部配置</td>\n<td>Mutating Webhook</td>\n<td>需要查找外部状态</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>校验需要查找其他资源是否存在</td>\n<td>Validating Webhook</td>\n<td>CEL 无法访问其他资源</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>校验需要调用外部 API</td>\n<td>Validating Webhook</td>\n<td>唯一选择</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>语义校验（如 cron 表达式合法性）</td>\n<td>Validating Webhook</td>\n<td>超出 CEL 表达能力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>原则：能用声明式（Schema/CEL）解决的，不要引入 Webhook。</strong> Webhook 是可用性依赖——如果 Webhook 服务不可达，影响范围取决于 <code>failurePolicy</code> 配置。</p>\n<h2 id=\"kubebuilder-webhook-实现\">Kubebuilder Webhook 实现</h2><p>Kubebuilder 通过 <code>CustomDefaulter</code> 和 <code>CustomValidator</code> 接口将 Webhook 开发简化为实现两个接口：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Defaulting Webhook 实现&#10;type DatabaseCustomDefaulter struct {&#10;    DefaultReplicas    int32&#10;    DefaultStorageSize string&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (d *DatabaseCustomDefaulter) Default(ctx context.Context, obj runtime.Object) error {&#10;    db := obj.(*databasev1.Database)&#10;&#10;    if db.Spec.Replicas == 0 {&#10;        db.Spec.Replicas = d.DefaultReplicas&#10;    }&#10;    if db.Spec.StorageSize == &quot;&quot; {&#10;        db.Spec.StorageSize = d.DefaultStorageSize&#10;    }&#10;    // 环境感知默认值：从 namespace annotation 读取&#10;    ns := &amp;corev1.Namespace{}&#10;    if err := webhookClient.Get(ctx, client.ObjectKey{Name: db.Namespace}, ns); err == nil {&#10;        if tier, ok := ns.Annotations[&quot;tier&quot;]; ok &amp;&amp; tier == &quot;production&quot; {&#10;            db.Spec.HighAvailability = ptr.To(true)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    return nil&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Defaulting Webhook 实现</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">type</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DatabaseCustomDefaulter</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    DefaultReplicas    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int32</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    DefaultStorageSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">string</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">d </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DatabaseCustomDefaulter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Default</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">ctx</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Context</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">obj</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> runtime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    db </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> obj.(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">databasev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.Spec.Replicas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        db.Spec.Replicas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d.DefaultReplicas</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> db.Spec.StorageSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        db.Spec.StorageSize </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> d.DefaultStorageSize</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 环境感知默认值：从 namespace annotation 读取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ns </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">corev1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> webhookClient.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Get</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(ctx, </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">client</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ObjectKey</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">{Name: db.Namespace}, ns); err </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier, ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ns.Annotations[</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"tier\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]; ok </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> tier </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"production\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            db.Spec.HighAvailability </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ptr.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">To</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">true</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// Validation Webhook 实现&#10;type DatabaseCustomValidator struct{}&#10;&#10;func (v *DatabaseCustomValidator) ValidateCreate(ctx context.Context, obj runtime.Object) (admission.Warnings, error) {&#10;    db := obj.(*databasev1.Database)&#10;    var allErrs field.ErrorList&#10;&#10;    // 跨资源校验：检查引用的 Secret 是否存在&#10;    secret := &amp;corev1.Secret{}&#10;    err := webhookClient.Get(ctx, client.ObjectKey{&#10;        Namespace: db.Namespace,&#10;        Name:      db.Spec.CredentialsSecretRef,&#10;    }, secret)&#10;    if apierrors.IsNotFound(err) {&#10;        allErrs = append(allErrs, field.NotFound(&#10;            field.NewPath(&quot;spec&quot;, &quot;credentialsSecretRef&quot;),&#10;            db.Spec.CredentialsSecretRef,&#10;        ))&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    if len(allErrs) &gt; 0 {&#10;        return nil, apierrors.NewInvalid(&#10;            schema.GroupKind{Group: &quot;database.example.com&quot;, Kind: &quot;Database&quot;},&#10;            db.Name, allErrs,&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;    return nil, nil&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (v *DatabaseCustomValidator) ValidateUpdate(ctx context.Context, oldObj, newObj runtime.Object) (admission.Warnings, error) {&#10;    oldDB := oldObj.(*databasev1.Database)&#10;    newDB := newObj.(*databasev1.Database)&#10;&#10;    // 不可变字段校验&#10;    if oldDB.Spec.Engine != newDB.Spec.Engine {&#10;        return nil, field.Forbidden(&#10;            field.NewPath(&quot;spec&quot;, &quot;engine&quot;),&#10;            &quot;engine is immutable after creation&quot;,&#10;        )&#10;    }&#10;    return v.ValidateCreate(ctx, newObj)&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (v *DatabaseCustomValidator) ValidateDelete(ctx context.Context, obj runtime.Object) (admission.Warnings, error) {&#10;