</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> runtime</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Object</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) (</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">admission</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Warnings</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">nil</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 删除无需额外校验</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"webhook-部署与-tls-配置\">Webhook 部署与 TLS 配置</h2><p>Webhook 以 HTTPS 端点形式暴露，API Server 通过 TLS 调用。证书管理是 Webhook 部署中最容易出问题的环节：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart LR&#10;    A[API Server] --&gt;|HTTPS 调用| B[Webhook Service]&#10;    B --&gt; C[Operator Pod :9443]&#10;    D[cert-manager] --&gt;|注入证书| E[Secret: webhook-tls]&#10;    E --&gt;|挂载| C&#10;    D --&gt;|注入 caBundle| F[WebhookConfiguration]\">flowchart LR\n    A[API Server] --&gt;|HTTPS 调用| B[Webhook Service]\n    B --&gt; C[Operator Pod :9443]\n    D[cert-manager] --&gt;|注入证书| E[Secret: webhook-tls]\n    E --&gt;|挂载| C\n    D --&gt;|注入 caBundle| F[WebhookConfiguration]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>证书管理方案</th>\n<th>复杂度</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>cert-manager + 注解</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>生产首选，自动轮转</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>手动自签证书</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>开发环境快速验证</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OLM 内置证书管理</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>通过 OLM 分发的 Operator</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>cert-manager 集成</strong>（生产推荐）：在 Webhook 的 <code>MutatingWebhookConfiguration</code> 上添加注解，cert-manager 自动注入 CA Bundle 并管理证书轮转：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"apiVersion: admissionregistration.k8s.io/v1&#10;kind: ValidatingWebhookConfiguration&#10;metadata:&#10;  name: database-operator-validating&#10;  annotations:&#10;    cert-manager.io/inject-ca-from: system/database-operator-serving-cert&#10;webhooks:&#10;  - name: vdatabase.kb.io&#10;    clientConfig:&#10;      service:&#10;        name: database-operator-webhook-service&#10;        namespace: system&#10;        path: /validate-database-v1alpha1-database&#10;    failurePolicy: Fail&#10;    timeoutSeconds: 10&#10;    sideEffects: None&#10;    admissionReviewVersions: [&#39;v1&#39;]\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">apiVersion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">admissionregistration.k8s.io/v1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">kind</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">ValidatingWebhookConfiguration</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">metadata</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">database-operator-validating</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">  annotations</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    cert-manager.io/inject-ca-from</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">system/database-operator-serving-cert</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">webhooks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">vdatabase.kb.io</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    clientConfig</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      service</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">database-operator-webhook-service</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        namespace</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">system</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">        path</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">/validate-database-v1alpha1-database</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    failurePolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Fail</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    timeoutSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    sideEffects</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    admissionReviewVersions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'v1'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"failurepolicy-与可用性权衡\">failurePolicy 与可用性权衡</h2><p><code>failurePolicy</code> 决定了 Webhook 不可达时 API Server 的行为：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>策略</th>\n<th>行为</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>Fail</code></td>\n<td>拒绝请求（503）</td>\n<td>安全关键校验（如 RBAC 增强）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>Ignore</code></td>\n<td>放行请求，跳过 Webhook</td>\n<td>非关键增强（如注入 annotation）</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>安全原则</strong>：对于安全相关的 Validating Webhook，必须使用 <code>Fail</code>。使用 <code>Ignore</code> 意味着攻击者可以通过使 Webhook 超时来绕过校验。</p>\n<p><strong>可用性保护措施</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>设置合理的 <code>timeoutSeconds</code>（推荐 5-10 秒，最大 30 秒）</li>\n<li>Webhook Pod 配置足够的资源限制</li>\n<li>使用 <code>namespaceSelector</code> 或 <code>objectSelector</code> 缩小 Webhook 作用范围</li>\n<li>排除 kube-system 等关键 namespace</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"yaml\" data-code=\"webhooks:&#10;  - name: vdatabase.kb.io&#10;    namespaceSelector:&#10;      matchExpressions:&#10;        - key: kubernetes.io/metadata.name&#10;          operator: NotIn&#10;          values: [&#39;kube-system&#39;, &#39;kube-public&#39;]&#10;    timeoutSeconds: 10&#10;    failurePolicy: Fail\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">webhooks</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">name</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">vdatabase.kb.io</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    namespaceSelector</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">      matchExpressions</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        - </span><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">key</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">kubernetes.io/metadata.name</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          operator</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">NotIn</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">          values</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: [</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'kube-system'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'kube-public'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    timeoutSeconds</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#22863A;--shiki-dark:#85E89D\">    failurePolicy</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">Fail</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"conversion-webhook\">Conversion Webhook</h2><p>当 CRD 存在多个 API 版本时，Conversion Webhook 负责版本间的自动转换。API Server 在以下场景触发 Conversion：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>用户通过 <code>v1beta1</code> 创建资源，另一个用户通过 <code>v1</code> 读取</li>\n<li>Storage Version 升级时迁移存量数据</li>\n<li>列表请求跨版本聚合</li>\n</ol>\n<p>Hub-Spoke 模型是实现 Conversion 的标准模式：选择一个内部表示（Hub），所有版本都实现到 Hub 的转换：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"go\" data-code=\"// v1alpha1 作为 Spoke，实现 ConvertTo/ConvertFrom&#10;func (src *DatabaseV1Alpha1) ConvertTo(dstRaw conversion.Hub) error {&#10;    dst := dstRaw.(*v1.Database)&#10;    dst.Spec.Replicas = src.Spec.Size  // 字段重命名&#10;    dst.Spec.Engine = src.Spec.Type    // 语义映射&#10;    return nil&#10;}&#10;&#10;func (dst *DatabaseV1Alpha1) ConvertFrom(srcRaw conversion.Hub) error {&#10;    src := srcRaw.(*v1.Database)&#10;    dst.Spec.Size = src.Spec.Replicas&#10;    dst.Spec.Type = src.Spec.Engine&#10;    return nil&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// v1alpha1 作为 Spoke，实现 ConvertTo/ConvertFrom</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">src </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DatabaseV1Alpha1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ConvertTo</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dstRaw</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> conversion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Hub</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dst </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dstRaw.(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">v1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dst.Spec.Replicas </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> src.Spec.Size  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 字段重命名</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dst.Spec.Engine </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> src.Spec.Type    </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 语义映射</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">dst </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">DatabaseV1Alpha1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">ConvertFrom</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">srcRaw</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> conversion</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Hub</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">error</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    src </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">:=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> srcRaw.(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">v1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">Database</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dst.Spec.Size </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> src.Spec.Replicas</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    dst.Spec.Type </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> src.Spec.Engine</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nil</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Admission Webhook 为 Operator 提供了 CRD Schema 和 CEL 无法覆盖的准入控制能力——跨资源校验、外部系统查找、环境感知默认值。但 Webhook 是可用性依赖：不可达时会影响 API 请求。设计原则是优先声明式方案（Schema/CEL），只在确有需要时引入 Webhook；部署时必须考虑证书管理（cert-manager）、failurePolicy 选择、timeout 设置和 namespace 排除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"相关文档\">相关文档</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"controller-runtime\">Controller-Runtime 架构与内部机制</a>——Webhook Server 在 Manager 中的角色</li>\n<li><a href=\"kubebuilder-operator-sdk\">Kubebuilder 与 Operator SDK 工程实践</a>——Webhook 脚手架的生成与配置</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Webhook 准入控制开发","id":"webhook-准入控制开发"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"准入链与 Webhook 位置","id":"准入链与-webhook-位置"},{"level":2,"text":"何时使用 Webhook vs CEL vs Controller","id":"何时使用-webhook-vs-cel-vs-controller"},{"level":2,"text":"Kubebuilder Webhook 实现","id":"kubebuilder-webhook-实现"},{"level":2,"text":"Webhook 部署与 TLS 配置","id":"webhook-部署与-tls-配置"},{"level":2,"text":"failurePolicy 与可用性权衡","id":"failurepolicy-与可用性权衡"},{"level":2,"text":"Conversion Webhook","id":"conversion-webhook"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"相关文档","id":"相关文档"}],"prev":{"title":"Kubebuilder 与 Operator SDK 工程实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/development/kubebuilder-operator-sdk"},"next":{"title":"Status Conditions 设计协议","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cloud-infrastructure/kubernetes-operator-patterns/advanced-patterns/status-conditions"}}